  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut zucchini into 2cm half-moons. Cut red onion into 2cm wedges.\n• Place zucchini, onion, pumpkin and a drizzle of olive oil on the lined oven tray. Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fe2b9734a4fa62d9a74ec9c/step-6de5209b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, bring the water to the boil in a medium saucepan.\n• Add couscous, crumbled vegetable stock (1 cube for 2P / 2 cubes for 4P) and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Stir to combine, cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 mins. Fluff up with a fork and set aside, uncovered.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fe2b9734a4fa62d9a74ec9c/step-e891b8b8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain and rinse chickpeas. Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat.\n• Stir in all-purpose seasoning and smoked paprika. Cook until fragrant, 1 min. Add chickpeas and cook, stirring, until well coated, 2-3 mins.\n• Add diced tomatoes and butter and stir to combine. Simmer until thickened, 4-5 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fe2b9734a4fa62d9a74ec9c/step-c90daca3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop parsley.\n• Stir roast veggies and parsley through the couscous and divide between bowls.\n• Top with chickpea stew and serve with yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fe2b9734a4fa62d9a74ec9c/step-3e9265c1.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
